       01  RECSIZE                      PIC S9(4) COMP-4 VALUE 66.
       01  RESULT                       PIC 9(4)  VALUE ZEROS.
       01  LOCK-COND                    PIC S9(4)  COMP-4 VALUE 1.
       01  USAGE-REC.
           05  FILLER                   PIC XX.
           05  K-CORP-CODE              PIC X(8).
           05  K-MONTHS                 OCCURS 14 TIMES.
               10  K-MTH-USAGE          PIC S9(9) COMP-4.
           05  K-MONTHS-DD              OCCURS 14 TIMES.
               10  K-MTH-USAGE-DD       PIC S9(9) COMP-4.

       01  RECEIPT-REC.
           05  R-CORP-CODE              PIC X(8).
           05  R-MONTHS                 OCCURS 14 TIMES.
               10  R-MTH-RECEIPTS       PIC S9(9) COMP-4.

       01  FILETABLE.
           05  FILENUMBER               PIC S9(4) COMP-4 VALUE 0.
           05  FILENAME                 PIC X(8)  VALUE "USAGEFIL".
           05  I-O-TYPE                 PIC S9(4) COMP-4 VALUE 2.
           05  A-MODE                   PIC S9(4) COMP-4 VALUE 1.
           05  PREV-OP                  PIC S9(4) COMP-4 VALUE 0.

       01  KSAM-STATUS.
           05  K-STAT-1                 PIC X.
           05  FILLER                   PIC X.

      **********************
      *                    *
      * PROCEDURE DIVISION *
      *                    *
      **********************

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

       1000-HOUSEKEEP.
           MOVE "C" TO MCXCBLERR-SCOPE.
           CALL "MCXCBLERR" USING MCXCBLERR-SCOPE.

           MOVE ZERO TO ABST-CNTR, ABST-CNTR-2, DAILY-TC-CNTR,
             DELETE-CNTR, USAGE-CNTR, RECEIPT-CNTR, TC-999-TOTAL-CNTR,
             TC-999-UNIQUE-CNTR, SCURCONV-PRICE-WHL.

           MOVE "N" TO TC-999-FLAG, TEST-FLAG, PROD-DATE-FLAG.
           MOVE SPACES TO NEW-MONTH-SW.

           OPEN INPUT MPLTINFO-I, MSTORERM-I.
           OPEN I-O MPLTINFO-O, DDAILYTC-O, USAGEFIL-O RECEIPTFIL-O.

           MOVE 1                         TO DATE-MODE.
           CALL "TDATECHK" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA.
           MOVE DATE-SLASH-OUT            TO MDY-DATE.
           MOVE DATE-YMD-OUT              TO YMD-SHORT.
           MOVE DATE-UNFORMATTED-TIME-OUT TO TIME-SAVE.
           MOVE MM-SHORT                  TO CURRENT-MONTH-9.

           MOVE "P 01"  TO  SEARCH-PLT-KEY.
      *    CALL "DBGET" USING BASE, DSET-MPLTINFO, MODE7,
      *        STATUS-AREA, ALL-ITEMS, BUF-MPLTINFO,
      *            SEARCH-PLT-KEY.
           MOVE SEARCH-PLT-KEY TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           READ MPLTINFO-I INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBGET ERR MPLTINF 8-IM" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.

           MOVE MPLTINFO-COMPANY         TO  COMP-SAVE.

      *----- IF THE COMPANY CODE = "111", WE NEED TO DETERMINE IF
      *----- WE ARE DEALING WITH THE AKRON MIX CENTER OR WITH AKRON
      *----- PLANT 1 (CORPORATE HEADQUARTERS).  WE CAN OBTAIN SOME
      *----- ADDITIONAL PLANT SPECIFIC DATA FROM THE "P 03" RECORD
      *----- OF MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "P 03"  TO  SEARCH-PLT-KEY.
           MOVE SEARCH-PLT-KEY TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           READ MPLTINFO-I INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
               MOVE MPLTINFO-STOREROOM       TO  STOREROOM-SAVE
               MOVE MPLTINFO-RECV-DEPT       TO  RECV-DEPT-SAVE
           ELSE
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                   MOVE SPACES               TO  STOREROOM-SAVE
                                                 RECV-DEPT-SAVE
               ELSE
                   MOVE "DBGET ERR MPLTINF-P 03" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.


      *---------- AN ATTEMPT IS MADE TO FIND THE JCW "TEST".  THIS
      *---------- JCW FACILITATES TESTING BY SETTING A "NO DELETE"
      *---------- FLAG.  IF THE "NO DELETE" FLAG IS SET, THE THE
      *---------- TRANSACTIONS ARE NOT DELETED OUT OF DDAILYTC
      *---------- AS NORMAL.  THIS PREVENTS HAVING TO CONTINUALLY
      *---------- REGENERATE TRANSACTIONS IN DDAILYTC DURING TESTING.
      *---------- AS A PRECAUTION AGAINST SOMEHOW HAVING THE JCW
      *---------- "TEST" IN EXISTENCE IN A LIVE SITUATION, THE JCW
      *---------- MUST BE SET TO 99 FOR THE "NO DELETE" FLAG TO BE SET.

           ACCEPT MC-LOCAL-DATA-AREA FROM LOCAL-DATA-AREA.
           IF JCW-TEST-281 = "9"
               MOVE "Y"                  TO  TEST-FLAG
               DISPLAY "*** WARNING|  THIS IS A TEST RUN OF CUTOFF| ***"
           ELSE
               MOVE "N"                  TO  TEST-FLAG.

      *---------- IN THIS SECTION, WE DETERMINE IF THIS IS A "NEW-MONTH"
      *---------- PLANT.  FOR "NEW-MONTH" PLANTS, A SPECIAL CUTOFF
      *---------- PROCEDURE IS DONE ON THE FIRST WORKING DAY OF THE
      *---------- MONTH IN WHICH ALL TRANSACTIONS FOR THE NEW MONTH
      *---------- ARE HELD BACK, AND ONLY ONES FROM THE PREVIOUS MONTH
      *---------- ARE LET THRU.  THIS IS DETERMINED BY A KEY IN
      *---------- THE "MPLTINFO" DATA SET.  IF THE PLANT IS DOES NOT
      *---------- HAVE THE "NEW-MONTH" KEY, THEN THE NORMAL PROCEDURE
      *---------- IS EXECUTED EVEN ON THE FIRST WORKING DAY OF THE MONTH.

           MOVE "NM01" TO SEARCH-PLT-KEY.
      *    CALL "DBGET" USING BASE, DSET-MPLTINFO, MODE7,
      *        STATUS-AREA, ALL-ITEMS, BUF-MPLTINFO,
      *            SEARCH-PLT-KEY.
           MOVE SEARCH-PLT-KEY TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           READ MPLTINFO-I INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "23"
               MOVE "N"   TO  NEW-MONTH-PLANT-SW
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
               MOVE "Y"   TO  NEW-MONTH-PLANT-SW
           ELSE
               MOVE "DBGET ERR MPLTINFO3" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.

      **************************************************************
      **   IN THIS SECTION, WE FIND OUT WHETHER IT IS A "NEW      **
      **   MONTH".  THIS IS DETERMINED BY THE PROGRAM "XUSEUPDT", **
      **   WHICH RUNS BEFORE THIS PROGRAM IN THE "BCUTOFF" JOB    **
      **   STREAM.  IF IT IS A NEW MONTH, "XUSEUPDT" SETS THE JCW **
      **   "MONTHEND" TO 1, ELSE IT SETS IT TO 0.                 **
      **************************************************************

           IF JCW-NEWMONTH-282 = "Y"
               DISPLAY "* THIS IS A NEW MONTH *"
               MOVE "Y"   TO  NEW-MONTH-SW
           ELSE
               DISPLAY "* THIS IS NOT A NEW MONTH *"
               MOVE "N"   TO  NEW-MONTH-SW.

      *---------- IF THE FILE "NEWMONTH" IS BUILT, WITH THE LOCKWORD
      *---------- "DONTPURG", THIS KEYS THIS PROGRAM THAT THE
      *---------- NEW MONTH PROCEDURE IS TO BE EXECUTED, EVEN IF IT
      *---------- IS NOT THE FIRST CUTOFF OF THE MONTH.  THIS FILE
      *---------- IS PURGED - IT MUST BE REBUILT FOR EACH ADDITIONAL
      *---------- TIME THE THIS PROGRAM IS TO DO THE NEW MONTH
      *---------- PROCEDURE.

           IF NEW-MONTH-PLANT-SW = "Y"
             IF NEW-MONTH-SW = "N"
               MOVE "NEWMONTH" TO CHKOBJ-FILE-NAME
               CALL "CCHKOBJ" USING CHKOBJ-FILE-NAME,
               CHKOBJ-RETURN-STATUS
               IF CHKOBJ-RETURN-STATUS = "00"
                  DISPLAY "* FORCED NEW-MONTH PROCEDURE INDICATED *"
                  MOVE "Y"   TO  NEW-MONTH-SW
                  MOVE "DLTF NEWMONTH" TO COMMAND-WORK
                  CALL "QCMDEXC" USING COMMAND-WORK, COMMAND-LEN.

           IF NEW-MONTH-SW = "Y"
               IF NEW-MONTH-PLANT-SW = "Y"
                   DISPLAY
                   "* NEW-MONTH CUTOFF PROCEDURE WILL BE EXECUTED *"
               ELSE
                   DISPLAY
                   "* NORMAL CUTOFF PROCEDURE WILL BE EXECUTED *".

      *---------- IF IT IS A NEW MONTH, AND A PLANT USING THE NEW-MONTH
      *---------- CUTOFF PROCEDURE, BUILD A CUTOFF DATE.  ONLY
      *---------- TRANSACTIONS WITH A DATE LESS THAN THE CUTOFF DATE
      *---------- WILL BE LET THRU IN THIS CASE.

           IF NEW-MONTH-SW = "Y"
               IF NEW-MONTH-PLANT-SW = "Y"
                   MOVE "00"     TO  CUTOFF-DD
                   MOVE MM-SHORT TO  CUTOFF-MM
                   MOVE YY-SHORT TO  CUTOFF-YY
                   IF CUTOFF-YY > "70"
                       MOVE "19" TO CUTOFF-CC
                   ELSE
                       MOVE "20" TO CUTOFF-CC
                   END-IF
                   DISPLAY "* CUTOFF DATE = ", CUTOFF-DATE, " *".

      *---------- HERE WE DETERMINE WHETHER "999" TRANSACTIONS ARE TO
      *---------- BE GENERATED FOR THIS PLANT.  IF THE KEY "TC99"
      *---------- EXISTS IN THE "MPLTINFO" DATASET, THEN THE PROGRAM
      *---------- WILL CREATE THE "999" TRANSACTIONS.  THESE TRANSACTIONS
      *---------- CONTAIN THE ENDING ONHAND QUANTITY FOR ANY CODE THAT
      *---------- HAD ACTIVITY.

           MOVE "TC99"                   TO  SEARCH-PLT-KEY.
      *    CALL "DBGET" USING BASE, DSET-MPLTINFO, MODE7,
      *        STATUS-AREA, ALL-ITEMS, BUF-MPLTINFO,
      *            SEARCH-PLT-KEY.
           MOVE SEARCH-PLT-KEY TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           READ MPLTINFO-I INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "23"
               MOVE "N"                  TO  TC-999-FLAG
               DISPLAY "* TC-999 TRANSACTIONS WILL NOT BE CREATED *"
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
               MOVE "Y"                  TO  TC-999-FLAG
               DISPLAY "* TC-999 TRANSACTIONS WILL BE CREATED *"
           ELSE
               MOVE "DBGET ERR MPLTINF2 8-IM" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.

      ***************************************
      ** GET THE CUTOFF SEQ CTR FROM       **
      ** MPLTINFO USING 'P 02' AS SEARCH   **
      ** KEY                               **
      ***************************************

           MOVE "P 02"  TO  SEARCH-PLT-KEY.
      *    CALL "DBGET" USING BASE, DSET-MPLTINFO, MODE7,
      *        STATUS-AREA, ALL-ITEMS, BUF-MPLTINFO,
      *            SEARCH-PLT-KEY.
           MOVE SEARCH-PLT-KEY TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           READ MPLTINFO-I INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBGET ERR MPLTINFO2 8-IM" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.

           MOVE MPLTINFO-SEQ            TO  CUTOFF-SEQ-SAVE
                                            CUTOFF-SEQ-SAVE2.

           PERFORM 6000-MAIN THRU 6990-MAIN-X.

       2000-STOP-RUN.
           CLOSE MPLTINFO-I, MPLTINFO-O, DDAILYTC-O, USAGEFIL-O,
                 RECEIPTFIL-O, MSTORERM-I.
           GOBACK.

       2100-BLOWUP.
           MOVE CUTOFF-SEQ-SAVE          TO   BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2).
           MOVE KEY-VALUE                TO   BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3).
           MOVE K-CORP-CODE              TO   BU-DISPLAY-FLD (4).
           MOVE "TCDLYABS"               TO   BU-PGM-NAME.
           CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE BU-PGM-NAME STATUS-AREA
             DUMMY-VIEW-AREA FILE-STATUS BU-DISPLAY-MSG
             BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.

      **************************************************************
      **                                                          **
      **             M A I N   P R O G R A M                      **
      **                                                          **
      **************************************************************

       6000-MAIN.
      *---------- THE ENTIRE DATABASE IS LOCKED FOR THE CUTOFF.  THIS
      *---------- WAS CHANGED FROM A LOCK ON THE TRANSACTION DATA SET
      *---------- TO INSURE THE INTEGRITY OF "999" TRANSACTIONS.
      *********** NOTE! FOR IBM, WE CANT DO A DATABASE LOCK.  SO,
      *********** WE MADE THE DDAILYTC LOGICAL VIEW KEY BE DATE/TIME
      *********** INSTEAD OF JUST DATE AS ON THE HP. THEN WE CAN
      *********** START AT END OF FILE, READ BACKWARDS, WRITE TO
      *********** ABSTFILE, CLOSE THE FILE, START BACK WHERE WE
      *********** WERE BEFORE (NEW TRANSACTIONS WILL HAVE A GREATER
      *********** DATE/TIME STAMP), READ BACKWARDS AND DELETE.

      *    CALL "DBLOCK" USING BASE, DSET-DDAILYTC, MODE1,
      *            STATUS-AREA.
      *    IF COND-WORD NOT = ZERO
      *        MOVE "DBLOCK ERR DDAILYTC 8-IM" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
      *        PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.
      *
      ****

      ** THE SEQUENTIAL ABSTRACT FILE THAT IS TRANSMITTED
      **   TO THE CORPORATE DATABASE IN AKRON IS OPENED
      ****
           OPEN OUTPUT ABST-FILE.
           OPEN OUTPUT USED-YEST-FILE.
           OPEN OUTPUT RECD-YEST-FILE.

      *---------- IF THE "999" TRANSACTIONS ARE TO BE MADE, OPEN THE
      *---------- FILE USED TO SORT THEM.

           IF TC-999-FLAG = "Y"
               MOVE "*LIBL"       TO CCRTFILE-LIBRARY
               MOVE "TC999IN"  TO CCRTFILE-FILE
               MOVE "0080"        TO CCRTFILE-RECORD-LENGTH
               MOVE "01000"       TO CCRTFILE-NO-RECORDS
               MOVE "01000"       TO CCRTFILE-INCREMENT-AMT
               MOVE  99           TO CCRTFILE-NO-INCREMENTS
               CALL "CCRTFILE" USING CCRTFILE-LIBRARY,
                                     CCRTFILE-FILE,
                                     CCRTFILE-RECORD-LENGTH,
                                     CCRTFILE-NO-RECORDS,
                                     CCRTFILE-INCREMENT-AMT,
                                     CCRTFILE-NO-INCREMENTS,
                                     CCRTFILE-STATUS
               IF CCRTFILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "CCRTFILE CREATE OF 'TC999IN' FAILED"
                  TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP
               END-IF
               MOVE "*LIBL"       TO CCRTFILE-LIBRARY
               MOVE "TC999OUT"  TO CCRTFILE-FILE
               MOVE "0080"        TO CCRTFILE-RECORD-LENGTH
               MOVE "01000"       TO CCRTFILE-NO-RECORDS
               MOVE "01000"       TO CCRTFILE-INCREMENT-AMT
               MOVE  99           TO CCRTFILE-NO-INCREMENTS
               CALL "CCRTFILE" USING CCRTFILE-LIBRARY,
                                     CCRTFILE-FILE,
                                     CCRTFILE-RECORD-LENGTH,
                                     CCRTFILE-NO-RECORDS,
                                     CCRTFILE-INCREMENT-AMT,
                                     CCRTFILE-NO-INCREMENTS,
                                     CCRTFILE-STATUS
               IF CCRTFILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "CCRTFILE CREATE OF 'TC999OUT' FAILED"
                  TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP
               END-IF
               OPEN OUTPUT TC-999-IN-FILE.

      *****************************************
      **                                     **
      **  WRITE THE HEADER LABEL FOR         **
      **  ABSTFILE (TC 001) IN THE FORM      **
      **   'YYMMDDHHMMSS001PLT'              **
      **                                     **
      *****************************************

           ADD  +1              TO  CUTOFF-SEQ-SAVE.
           MOVE YMD-SHORT       TO  DAILY-R-C-DATE.
           MOVE TIME-SAVE       TO  DAILY-R-C-TIME.
      *****IF MPLTINFO-PLT-NAME = "MIX CENTER"   *REPLACED 24JAN97*
           IF (COMP-SAVE = "111" AND STOREROOM-SAVE = "125A"
             AND RECV-DEPT-SAVE = "125A")
               MOVE "11M"       TO  DAILY-R-C-PLT
           ELSE
               MOVE COMP-SAVE   TO  DAILY-R-C-PLT.

           MOVE "001"           TO  DAILY-R-C-TC.
           MOVE SPACES          TO  DAILY-R-C-900.
           MOVE CUTOFF-SEQ-SAVE TO  DAILY-R-C-CUTOFF-SEQ.
           MOVE DLY-RCD-CNTR-TC TO  ABST-RCD.
           WRITE  ABST-RCD.
           ADD +1  TO  ABST-CNTR, ABST-CNTR-2.

      *------ WE GO TO THE VERY END OF THE FILE AND SAVE THAT
      *------ SPOT.  THEN WE START AT BEGINNING AND READ UP TO THAT
      *------ POINT.  ANY NEW TRANSACTIONS GET ADDED AFTER ENDING POINT

           READ DDAILYTC-O LAST RECORD INTO BUF-DDAILYTC
              AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "1"
               MOVE "Y" TO NO-RECORDS-FLAG
               GO TO 6210-CLOSE-ABSTFILE
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "ERROR READING LAST DDAILYTC RECORD"
                 TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.

           MOVE BUF-DDAILYTC TO SAVE-ENDING-POINT-REC.

           MOVE SPACES TO DLYTCDTE OF DDAILYTC-REC-O.
           START DDAILYTC-O KEY >= DLYTCDTE OF DDAILYTC-REC-O
              INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "START ERROR DDAILYTC     " TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.
           MOVE "N" TO FOUND-ENDING-POINT.

      ****
      ** THE FOLLOWING IS A LOOP, WHICH READS THE DDAILYTC DETAIL
      **   SEGMENT OF THE DATABASE, WRITES THE RECORD TO THE ABSTRACT
      **   FILE, RELEASES THE RECORD TO THE SORT, AND DELETES EACH
      **    RECORD.
      ****

       6100-GET-TC-RCD.

      ****
      ** THE DDAILYTC RECORDS ARE READ SERIALLY (MODE2)
      ****
           IF FOUND-ENDING-POINT = "Y"
               GO TO 6210-CLOSE-ABSTFILE.

      *    CALL "DBGET" USING BASE, DSET-DDAILYTC, MODE2,
      *      STATUS-AREA, ALL-ITEMS, BUF-DDAILYTC, DUMMY-ARG.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ DDAILYTC-O NEXT INTO BUF-DDAILYTC
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBGET ERR DDAILY 8-GTR" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.

           IF DDAILYTC-DATE = ENDING-POINT-DATE
               IF DDAILYTC-TIME = ENDING-POINT-TIME
                   IF BUF-DDAILYTC = SAVE-ENDING-POINT-REC
                       MOVE "Y" TO FOUND-ENDING-POINT.

      *------ PLANT STARTUP HAS FLAG WHETHER PO PRICE IN TRANS SHOULD
      *------ BE CONVERTED TO LOCAL CURRENCY.  (PO TRANS ARE HANDLED
      *------ IN THE PROGRAM).  IF SO, WE ALSO PASS THE LOCAL CURRENCY
      *------ IN THE CURRENCY FIELD OF THE TRANSACTION.  THIS WAY, THE
      *------ CURRENCY CODE IN THE TRANSACTION WILL MATCH THE CURRENCY
      *------ THE PRICE IS EXPRESSED IN.  SCURCONV-CUR-CONV-SW IS THE
      *------ MPLTINFO FLAG RETURNED FROM SCURCONV: WE ONLY CONVERT THE
      *------ PRICE IF IT IS A "Y"

           IF DDAILYTC-TC = "325" AND TC325-CURRENCY-CODE > SPACES
               MOVE TC325-PO-UNIT-PRICE  TO   SCURCONV-PRICE-DEC
               MOVE TC325-CURRENCY-CODE  TO   SCURCONV-CUR-CODE
               PERFORM 9110-CALL-SCURCONV
               IF SCURCONV-CUR-CONV-SW = "Y"
                   PERFORM 9120-FIX-325
               ELSE
                   NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
           IF DDAILYTC-TC = "425" AND TC425-CURRENCY-CODE > SPACES
               MOVE TC425-PO-UNIT-PRICE  TO   SCURCONV-PRICE-DEC
               MOVE TC425-CURRENCY-CODE  TO   SCURCONV-CUR-CODE
               PERFORM 9110-CALL-SCURCONV
               IF SCURCONV-CUR-CONV-SW = "Y"
                   MOVE SCURCONV-PRICE-DEC TO TC425-PO-UNIT-PRICE
                   MOVE SCURCONV-HOME-CURRENCY TO TC425-CURRENCY-CODE
               ELSE
                   NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
           IF (DDAILYTC-TC = "323" OR DDAILYTC-TC = "324")
           AND TC323-CURRENCY-CODE > SPACES
               MOVE TC323-UNIT-PRICE     TO   SCURCONV-PRICE-DEC
               MOVE TC323-CURRENCY-CODE  TO   SCURCONV-CUR-CODE
               PERFORM 9110-CALL-SCURCONV
               IF SCURCONV-CUR-CONV-SW = "Y"
                   PERFORM 9130-FIX-323
               ELSE
                   NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
           IF (DDAILYTC-TC = "423" OR DDAILYTC-TC = "424")
           AND TC423-CURRENCY-CODE > SPACES
               MOVE TC423-UNIT-PRICE     TO   SCURCONV-PRICE-DEC
               MOVE TC423-CURRENCY-CODE  TO   SCURCONV-CUR-CODE
               PERFORM 9110-CALL-SCURCONV
               IF SCURCONV-CUR-CONV-SW = "Y"
                   MOVE SCURCONV-PRICE-DEC TO TC423-UNIT-PRICE
                   MOVE SCURCONV-HOME-CURRENCY TO TC423-CURRENCY-CODE.

           ADD 1 TO DAILY-TC-CNTR.

      *---------- CERTAIN TRANSACTIONS ARE LET THRU REGARDLESS OF
      *           WETHER IT IS A NEW MONTH.  THESE ARE TRANSACTIONS
      *           THAT DO NOT AFFECT INVENTORY - SUCH AS DOCK RECEIPTS,
      *           PO CREATIONS, ETC.  NOTE: TREAT THE "400" SERIES
      *           TRANSACTIONS THE SAME AS THE "300" SERIES.
      **** NOTE: THE FOLLOWING IF STATEMENT MUST MATCH THE ONE IN
      **** PARAGRAPH 6300-DELETE-DDAILYTC.   *MATCHING IF STMT*
DP9802****  02FEB1998 ADDED "5" AND "6" SERIES TRANSACTIONS TO THE
DP9802****   FOLLOWING IF STATEMENT

           MOVE DDAILYTC-TC              TO   TC-WORK.
DP9802     IF TC-1 = "3" OR "4" OR "5" OR "6"
             IF TC-2-3 = "20" OR "21" OR "22" OR "23" OR "24" OR "26"
              OR "2D" OR "50" OR "51" OR "52" OR "53" OR "54" OR "60"
              OR "61" OR "70" OR "71" OR "90" OR "92" OR "93"
               GO TO 6120-SKIP-DATE-CHECK.

      *----------FOR PLANTS WITH A SPECIAL MONTH END CUTOFF INDICATOR
      *          IN MPLTINFO, WE LET THRU ONLY TRANSACTIONS FOR THE
      *          PREVIOUS MONTH ON THE FIRST WORKING DAY OF A MONTH,
      *          AND HOLD BACK ALL TRANSACTIONS FOR THE NEW MONTH.
      *          THIS IS TO FACILITATE MONTH END PROCESSING BY
      *          ACCOUNTING PROGRAMS (TO WHOM THIS TRANSACTION DATA
      *          IS SENT).  FOR RAW MATERIALS WE USE PRODUCTION DATE
      *          WHICH IS IN WO FIELD.

           IF NEW-MONTH-SW = "Y" AND NEW-MONTH-PLANT-SW = "Y"
               PERFORM 9000-DETERMINE-TRANS-DATE
               IF CYMD-BUILD > CUTOFF-DATE-CN
                   GO TO 6100-GET-TC-RCD.

       6120-SKIP-DATE-CHECK.

      **************************************************************
      **   IF AN ISSUE, RETURN, RETURN WITH VALUE, OR ADJUSTMENT  **
      **   (TC 333, 330, 331, OR 332), USAGE IS AFFECTED, SO WE   **
      **   UPDATE USAGEFIL FOR THESE TRANSACTIONS.  HERE WE WRITE **
      **   THE CODE AND USAGE QTY TO A FILE, WHICH WILL BE USED   **
      **   IN THE USAGE UPDATE PROCEDURE AFTER ABSTFILE HAS BEEN  **
      **   CLOSED.  THE REASON WE CANT UPDATE HERE IS THAT WE     **
      **   CANT DO A "CKLOCK" WITH A "DBLOCK" IN PLACE. (DDAILYTC)**
      **   IN ADDITION, THIS PERMANENT FILE TELLS "XUSEUPDT"      **
      **   WHICH CODES HAVE HAD USAGE ON THE PREVIOUS DAY, AND    **
      **   THEREFORE WHICH CODES MUST HAVE A 0 MOVED INTO THEIR   **
      **   "USED YESTERDAY" FIELD.                                **
      **************************************************************

      *----------FOR RAW MATERIAL CODES WHICH WERE ISSUED BY THE
      *          BANBURY EXPLOSION, THE PRODUCTION DATE OF THE
      *          BANBURY EXPLOSION IS USED TO UPDATE USAGE, RATHER
      *          THAN THE ACTUAL TRANSACTION DATE.
      *          IF THERE IS A PRODUCTION DATE IN THE WORKORDER FIELD
      *          (IN THE FORMAT 12-02-84, FOR EXAMPLE), THIS SIGNIFIES
      *          A BANBURY ISSUE.

      *------ ON 9/13/88 TOOK OUT RETURNS WITH VALUE AS AN UPDATER
      *------ OF USAGE.  COMMENTED OUT IN CASE ANYONE COMPLAINS.

           IF DDAILYTC-TC                =  "333"
                                         OR "433"
                                         OR "330"
                                         OR "430"
      *                                  OR "331"
      *                                  OR "431"
                                         OR "332"
               PERFORM 9000-DETERMINE-TRANS-DATE
               MOVE TC333-CORPCODE       TO   USED-YEST-CODE
               MOVE MM-BUILD             TO   CONVERT-MONTH
               MOVE CONVERT-MONTH        TO   USED-YEST-MONTH
               IF DDAILYTC-TC = "333"
                   MOVE TC333-QTY        TO   USED-YEST-QTY
                   WRITE USED-YEST-RCD
               ELSE
               IF DDAILYTC-TC = "433"
                   MOVE TC433-QTY        TO   USED-YEST-QTY
                   WRITE USED-YEST-RCD
               ELSE
               IF DDAILYTC-TC = "330"
                   MULTIPLY TC330-QTY BY -1 GIVING USED-YEST-QTY
                   WRITE USED-YEST-RCD
               ELSE
               IF DDAILYTC-TC = "430"
                   MULTIPLY TC430-QTY BY -1 GIVING USED-YEST-QTY
                   WRITE USED-YEST-RCD
      *        ELSE
      *        IF DDAILYTC-TC = "331"
      *            MULTIPLY TC331-QTY BY -1 GIVING USED-YEST-QTY
      *            WRITE USED-YEST-RCD
      *        ELSE
      *        IF DDAILYTC-TC = "431"
      *            MULTIPLY TC431-QTY BY -1 GIVING USED-YEST-QTY
      *            WRITE USED-YEST-RCD
               ELSE
               IF DDAILYTC-TC = "332"
                   MULTIPLY TC332-ADJ-QTY BY -1 GIVING USED-YEST-QTY
                   WRITE USED-YEST-RCD.

DP9801     IF (DDAILYTC-TC =  "323" OR "423" OR "523" OR "623"
DP9801                     OR "324" OR "424" OR "524" OR "624")
DP9801       AND (TC323-CORPCODE NOT = "NON-STR")
DP9801         PERFORM 9000-DETERMINE-TRANS-DATE
               MOVE TC323-CORPCODE       TO   RECD-YEST-CODE
               MOVE MM-BUILD             TO   CONVERT-MONTH
               MOVE CONVERT-MONTH        TO   RECD-YEST-MONTH
DP9801         IF DDAILYTC-TC = "323" OR "324" OR "523" OR "524"
                   MOVE TC323-CODED-RCV-QTY TO   RECD-YEST-QTY
                   WRITE RECD-YEST-RCD
               ELSE
DP9801         IF DDAILYTC-TC = "423" OR "424" OR "623" OR "624"
                   MOVE TC423-CODED-RCV-QTY TO   RECD-YEST-QTY
                   WRITE RECD-YEST-RCD.

       6200-WRITE-ABSTFILE.
           MOVE COMP-SAVE                TO   DDAILYTC-PLT.
           MOVE BUF-DDAILYTC             TO   ABST-RCD.
           ADD +1         TO  ABST-CNTR, ABST-CNTR-2.
           WRITE ABST-RCD.

      *---------- IF 999 TRANSACTIONS ARE TO BE MADE, GET THE ONHAND
      *---------- THAT CODE AND WRITE IT TO A FILE.

           IF TC-999-FLAG = "N"
               GO TO 6205-SKIP-TC-999.

      *---------- ANY TRANSACTIONS WITH A CODE OF "NON-STR" ARE NON-
      *---------- STOREROOM, AND THUS NO TC-999 CAN BE GENERATED

           IF TC333-CORPCODE = "NON-STR"
               GO TO 6205-SKIP-TC-999.

      *---------- SOME TRANSACTIONS HAVE NO CORPORATE CODE (FREIGHT
      *---------- INFO, P.O. HEADERS, ETC).  ALSO WE DONT WANT TO GENERATE
      *---------- TC-999 TRANS FOR SOME TRANS THAT DONT AFFECT ONHAND.
DP9802*----------  02FEB1998 ADDED "54" (FOR 354) TO THE FOLLOWINF IF STMT)

           MOVE DDAILYTC-TC              TO   TC-WORK.
           IF TC-1 = "3" OR TC-1 = "4"
DP9802         IF TC-2-3 = "50" OR "51" OR "52" OR "53" OR "54" OR
                 "27" OR "28" OR "60" OR "61" OR "70" OR
                 "71" OR "20" OR "21" OR "22" OR "2D"
                   GO TO 6205-SKIP-TC-999.

           IF TC-WORK = "500" OR "105"
              GO TO 6205-SKIP-TC-999.

           MOVE TC333-CORPCODE TO ST-CODE-ARG.
      *    CALL "DBGET" USING BASE, DSET-MSTORERM, MODE7, STATUS-AREA,
      *      ALL-ITEMS, BUF-MSTORERM, ST-CODE-ARG.
           MOVE ST-CODE-ARG TO CORPCDE OF MSTORERM-REC-I.
           READ MSTORERM-I INTO BUF-MSTORERM
               INVALID KEY MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "23"
               DISPLAY "***** NO CODE FOR TRANSACTION ", DDAILYTC-TC,
                 ", CODE-PARM = ", TC333-CORPCODE, " *****"
               GO TO 6205-SKIP-TC-999
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBGET ERR MODE 7 6200-WA" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.

           MOVE SPACES                   TO   TC-999-IN-REC.
           MOVE "999"                    TO   TC-999-IN-TC.
           MOVE COMP-SAVE                TO   TC-999-IN-PLT.

      *-----USE CURRENT DATE AND TIME FOR TC999.
      *    MOVE DDAILYTC-DATE            TO   TC-999-IN-DATE.
      *    MOVE DDAILYTC-TIME            TO   TC-999-IN-TIME.

           MOVE 1                         TO DATE-MODE.
           CALL "TDATECHK" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA.
           MOVE DATE-YMD-OUT              TO TC-999-IN-DATE.
           MOVE DATE-UNFORMATTED-TIME-OUT TO TC-999-IN-TIME.
           MOVE TC333-CORPCODE           TO   TC-999-IN-CODE.
           MOVE STR-ONHAND               TO   TC-999-IN-ONHAND.
           MOVE STR-UM                   TO   TC-999-IN-UM.

           CALL "SONORDER" USING BASE, CORP-CODE, SONORDER-PARMS,
             COMP-SAVE, STATUS-AREA, BU-DISPLAY-MSG, BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
           IF BU-DISPLAY-MSG-1 NOT = SPACES
               DISPLAY "******** SONORDER ERROR FOR CODE ", CORP-CODE
               DISPLAY BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE SPACES               TO   BU-DISPLAY-MSG.

           MOVE SONORDER-TOTAL-ONORDER   TO   TC-999-IN-ONORDER.
           WRITE TC-999-IN-REC.

       6205-SKIP-TC-999.
           GO TO 6100-GET-TC-RCD.

       6210-CLOSE-ABSTFILE.
      *********IF MPLTINFO-PLT-NAME = "MIX CENTER"   *REPLACED 24JAN97*
               IF (COMP-SAVE = "111" AND STOREROOM-SAVE = "125A"
                 AND RECV-DEPT-SAVE = "125A")
                   MOVE "11M"     TO DAILY-R-C-PLT
               ELSE
                   MOVE COMP-SAVE TO DAILY-R-C-PLT.

      *---------- IF THE "999" TRANSACTIONS ARE WANTED, SORT THE
      *---------- FILE, ELIMINATE DUPLICATE CODES, AND WRITE THE
      *---------- TRANSACTIONS TO "ABSTFILE" BEFORE WRITING THE FINAL
      *---------- CONTROL RECORD.  OTHERWISE JUST WRITE THE FINAL
      *---------- CONTROL RECORD.

           IF TC-999-FLAG = "Y"
               PERFORM 7000-WRITE-999-RECORDS THRU 7990-W9R-X.

           MOVE YMD-SHORT  TO  DAILY-R-C-DATE.
           MOVE TIME-SAVE  TO  DAILY-R-C-TIME.
           MOVE "900"      TO  DAILY-R-C-TC.
           ADD  +1         TO  ABST-CNTR, ABST-CNTR-2.
           ADD TC-999-UNIQUE-CNTR        TO  ABST-CNTR.
           MOVE ABST-CNTR  TO  DAILY-R-C-CNTR.
           MOVE CUTOFF-SEQ-SAVE  TO  DAILY-R-C-CUTOFF-SEQ.
           MOVE DLY-RCD-CNTR-TC  TO  ABST-RCD.
           WRITE ABST-RCD.

      *----- CLOSE THE TRANSACTION FILE
           CLOSE ABST-FILE.
           ACCEPT TIME-WORK FROM TIME.
           DISPLAY "* ABSTFILE NUMBER ", CUTOFF-SEQ-SAVE,
             " CLOSED SUCCESSFULLY AT ", TIME-WORK, " *".
           CLOSE USED-YEST-FILE.
           OPEN INPUT USED-YEST-FILE.
DP9801     CLOSE RECD-YEST-FILE.
           OPEN INPUT RECD-YEST-FILE.

       6220-REWIND-DDAILYTC.
           IF NO-RECORDS-FLAG = "Y"
               GO TO 6320-UNLOCK-DDAILYTC.

      **************************************************************
      **   WE CALL "DBCLOSE" IN MODE 3 TO REWIND THE DDAILYTC DATA**
      **   SET.  THIS IS IN PREPERATION FOR ANOTHER FORWARD SERIAL**
      **   READ THROUGH THE DATA SET TO DO THE DELETES.           **
      **************************************************************
      *
      *    CALL "DBCLOSE" USING BASE, DSET-DDAILYTC, MODE3,
      *      STATUS-AREA.
      *    IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
      *        MOVE "DBCLOSE ERR REWIND 8-RD" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
      *        PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.
      *

      *------ FOR IBM ONLY, WE START AT BEGINNING AND DELETE UNTIL
      *------ THE ENDING POINT WE SAVED EARLIER IS REACHED. ANY
      *------ TRANSACTIONS CREATED AFTER CUTOFF STARTS RUNNING WILL
      *------ GO TO THE END OF THE FILE AFTER THE SAVE-ENDING-POING

           MOVE SPACES TO DLYTCDTE OF DDAILYTC-REC-O.
           START DDAILYTC-O KEY >= DLYTCDTE OF DDAILYTC-REC-O
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "START ERROR BEFORE DELETES DDAILY"
                 TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.
           MOVE "N" TO FOUND-ENDING-POINT.

      **************************************************************
      **   NOW THAT ABST-FILE IS SAFELY CLOSED, AND DDAILYTC HAS  **
      **   BEEN REWOUND, WE DO A FORWARD SERIAL READ AND DELETE   **
      **   ALL DDAILYTC ENTRYS THAT WERE WRITTEN TO ABSTFILE.     **
      **************************************************************

       6300-DELETE-DDAILYTC.
           IF FOUND-ENDING-POINT = "Y"
               GO TO 6320-UNLOCK-DDAILYTC.

      *    CALL "DBGET" USING BASE DSET-DDAILYTC MODE2 STATUS-AREA
      *      ALL-ITEMS BUF-DDAILYTC DUMMY-ARG.
           READ DDAILYTC-O NEXT INTO BUF-DDAILYTC
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "1"
               GO TO 6320-UNLOCK-DDAILYTC
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBGET ERR DDAILY 8-DD" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.

           IF DDAILYTC-DATE = ENDING-POINT-DATE
               IF DDAILYTC-TIME = ENDING-POINT-TIME
                   IF BUF-DDAILYTC = SAVE-ENDING-POINT-REC
                       MOVE "Y" TO FOUND-ENDING-POINT.

      **** NOTE: THE FOLLOWING IF STATEMENT MUST MATCH THE ONE IN
      **** PARAGRAPH 6100-GET-TC-RCD.   *MATCHING IF STMT*
DP9802****  02FEB1998 ADDED "5" AND "6" SERIES TRANSACTIONS TO THE
DP9802****   FOLLOWING IF STATEMENT
           MOVE DDAILYTC-TC              TO   TC-WORK.
DP9802     IF TC-1 = "3" OR "4" OR "5" OR "6"
             IF TC-2-3 = "20" OR "21" OR "22" OR "23" OR "24" OR "26"
              OR "2D" OR "50" OR "51" OR "52" OR "53" OR "54" OR "60"
              OR "61" OR "70" OR "71" OR "90" OR "92" OR "93"
               GO TO 6310-SKIP-DELETE-CHECK.

           IF NEW-MONTH-SW = "Y" AND NEW-MONTH-PLANT-SW = "Y"
               PERFORM 9000-DETERMINE-TRANS-DATE
               IF CYMD-BUILD > CUTOFF-DATE-CN
                   GO TO 6300-DELETE-DDAILYTC.

       6310-SKIP-DELETE-CHECK.
      *--------- IF THE "TEST" FLAG IS SET, THIS MEANS WE ARE TESTING
      *---------- THE PROGRAM AND DO NOT WANT TO DELETE THE TRANSACTIONS
      *---------- FROM DDAILYTC.

           IF TEST-FLAG = "Y"
               NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
      *        CALL "DBDELETE" USING BASE DSET-DDAILYTC MODE1
      *          STATUS-AREA
               DELETE DDAILYTC-O
                 INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
               END-DELETE
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "DBDELETE DDAILY 8-DD" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.

           ADD 1 TO DELETE-CNTR.

           GO TO 6300-DELETE-DDAILYTC.


       6320-UNLOCK-DDAILYTC.
           ACCEPT TIME-WORK FROM TIME.
           DISPLAY "* DDAILYTC DELETES COMPLETED AT ",
             TIME-SAVE, " *".
           DISPLAY "* ", DAILY-TC-CNTR, " IN DDAILYTC *".
           DISPLAY "* ", ABST-CNTR-2, " WRITTEN TO ABSTFILE, PLUS ",
             TC-999-UNIQUE-CNTR, " TC-999 RECORDS, FOR A TOTAL OF ",
             ABST-CNTR.
           DISPLAY "* ", DELETE-CNTR, " DELETED FROM DDAILYTC *".

       6330-UPDATE-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "P 02" TO MPLTINFO-KEY.
      *------ 'SCURCONV' SUBPROG GETS AN MPLTINFO ENTRY AND LOSES OUR
      *------ CURRENT ENTRY, SO WE GOTTA GET THE P02 ENTRY AGAIN
      *    CALL "DBGET" USING BASE, DSET-MPLTINFO, MODE7,
      *      STATUS-AREA, ALL-ITEMS, BUF-MPLTINFO,
      *      MPLTINFO-KEY.
           MOVE MPLTINFO-KEY TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC-O.
           READ MPLTINFO-O INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBGET ERR 2 MPLTFINO P 02" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.

           MOVE SPACES  TO  MPLTINFO-DATA.
           MOVE CUTOFF-SEQ-SAVE  TO  MPLTINFO-SEQ.
           MOVE YMD-SHORT        TO  MPLTINFO-CUTOFF-DATE.

      *    CALL "DBUPDATE" USING BASE, DSET-MPLTINFO, MODE1,
      *        STATUS-AREA, ALL-ITEMS, BUF-MPLTINFO.
           REWRITE MPLTINFO-REC-O FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBUPDATE ERR CUTTOF-SEQ" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.

           DISPLAY "* SEQUENCE COUNTER UPDATED FROM ",
             CUTOFF-SEQ-SAVE2, " TO ", CUTOFF-SEQ-SAVE, " *".

      *------ IF THE FLAG FILE 'DO999ALL' EXISTS, THE SUBPROGRAM WILL
      *------ APPEND A COMPLETE 999 TRANSACTION FILE TO ABSTFILE.
      *------ THIS WILL READ THRU MSTORERM AND CREATE A 999 TRANS FOR
      *------ EACH CODE.  IF NOT, IT WILL RETURN WITHOUT PROCESSING.

           MOVE SPACES TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG-1.
           CALL "CTC999" USING BASE, STATUS-AREA, TC999-PARMS,
             BU-DISPLAY-MSG, BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
           IF BU-DISPLAY-MSG-1 NOT = SPACES
               PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.

      *    CALL "DBUNLOCK" USING BASE, DSET-DDAILYTC, MODE1,
      *            STATUS-AREA.
      *    IF COND-WORD NOT = ZERO
      *        MOVE "DBUNLOCK ERR DDAILY 8-UM" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
      *        PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.

       6400-UPDATE-USAGE-FILE.

       6410-UPDATE-USAGE-LOOP.
      **************************************************************
      **   HERE, WE UPDATE THE MONTHLY USAGE FILE "USAGEFIL".     **
      **************************************************************

           READ USED-YEST-FILE AT END
               CLOSE USED-YEST-FILE
               GO TO 6440-UNLOCK-USAGE-FILE.

           MOVE USED-YEST-CODE       TO   KEY-VALUE.
      *    CALL "CKREADBYKEY" USING FILETABLE KSAM-STATUS
      *        USAGE-REC KEY-VALUE KEY-LOC RECSIZE.
           MOVE KEY-VALUE TO CORPCDE OF USAGEFIL-REC-O.
           READ USAGEFIL-O INTO USAGE-REC
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "23"
               DISPLAY
               "CODE ", KEY-VALUE, " DOES NOT EXIST IN USAGEFIL"
               GO TO 6410-UPDATE-USAGE-LOOP
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "READ USAGEFIL ERROR" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.

           IF USED-YEST-MONTH = CURRENT-MONTH-9
               ADD USED-YEST-QTY     TO   K-MTH-USAGE (13)
           ELSE
               ADD USED-YEST-QTY     TO   K-MTH-USAGE (USED-YEST-MONTH).
           ADD USED-YEST-QTY         TO   K-MTH-USAGE (14).
      *    CALL "CKREWRITE" USING FILETABLE KSAM-STATUS USAGE-REC
      *        RECSIZE.
           REWRITE USAGEFIL-REC-O FROM USAGE-REC
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "REWRITE USAGEFIL ERROR" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.

           ADD 1 TO USAGE-CNTR.

           GO TO 6410-UPDATE-USAGE-LOOP.

       6440-UNLOCK-USAGE-FILE.
           ACCEPT TIME-WORK FROM TIME.
           DISPLAY "* USAGE UPDATES COMPLETE AT ", TIME-WORK, " *".
           DISPLAY "* ", USAGE-CNTR, " USAGES UPDATED *".

       6420-UPDATE-RECEIPTS-FILE.

       6430-UPDATE-RECEIPTS-LOOP.
      **************************************************************
      **  HERE, WE UPDATE THE MONTHLY RECEIPTS FILE "RECEIPTFIL". **
      **************************************************************

           READ RECD-YEST-FILE AT END
               CLOSE RECD-YEST-FILE
               GO TO 6450-UNLOCK-RECEIPTS-FILE.

           MOVE RECD-YEST-CODE       TO   KEY-VALUE.
           MOVE KEY-VALUE TO CORPCDE OF RECEIPTFIL-REC-O.
           READ RECEIPTFIL-O INTO RECEIPT-REC
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "23"
               DISPLAY
               "CODE ", KEY-VALUE, " DOES NOT EXIST IN RECEIPTFIL"
               GO TO 6430-UPDATE-RECEIPTS-LOOP
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "READ RECEIPTFIL ERROR" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.

           IF RECD-YEST-MONTH = CURRENT-MONTH-9
               ADD RECD-YEST-QTY TO R-MTH-RECEIPTS(13)
           ELSE
               ADD RECD-YEST-QTY TO R-MTH-RECEIPTS(RECD-YEST-MONTH).
           ADD RECD-YEST-QTY     TO R-MTH-RECEIPTS(14).
           REWRITE RECEIPTFIL-REC-O FROM RECEIPT-REC
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "REWRITE RECEIPTFILE ERROR" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.

           ADD 1 TO RECEIPT-CNTR.

           GO TO 6430-UPDATE-RECEIPTS-LOOP.

       6450-UNLOCK-RECEIPTS-FILE.
           ACCEPT TIME-WORK FROM TIME.
           DISPLAY "* RECEIPT UPDATES COMPLETE AT ", TIME-WORK, " *".
           DISPLAY "* ", RECEIPT-CNTR, " RECEIPTS UPDATED *".

      *------ DELETE ANY EXTRA FILES CREATED.
           MOVE "*LIBL"      TO CCRTFILE-LIBRARY.
           MOVE "TC999IN" TO CCRTFILE-FILE.
           CALL "CDLTFILE" USING CCRTFILE-LIBRARY, CCRTFILE-FILE,
             CCRTFILE-STATUS.
           MOVE "TC999OUT" TO CCRTFILE-FILE.
           CALL "CDLTFILE" USING CCRTFILE-LIBRARY, CCRTFILE-FILE,
             CCRTFILE-STATUS.

      *----------PRINT OUT THE DAILY ACTIVITY BY CALLING THE SUBPROGRAM
      *----------"TCDLYAB2" (REPRINT OF DAILY ACTIVITY SUBPROG).  THE
      *----------PARAMETERS "A1" MUST BE PASSED THRU THE JOB STREAM,
      *----------TELLING "TCDLYAB2" TO PRINT ALL TRANSACTIONS, AND TO
      *----------USE THE FILE "ABSTFILE".

           MOVE SPACES              TO HD-ROUTE-DATA.
           MOVE "MATERIALS CONTROL" TO HD-NAME.
           MOVE "097"               TO HD-SPOOLER-NUMBER.
           MOVE "X"                 TO HD-PAPER-FLAG.
           MOVE 1                   TO HD-NO-OF-COPIES.
           MOVE SPACES              TO R9-RECORD.
           MOVE "X"                 TO R9-RPTA-KEY.
           MOVE "1"                 TO R9-FILE-KEY.
           CALL "TCDLYAB2" USING RET-CODE, BASE, STATUS-AREA,
             HD-ROUTE-DATA, R9-RECORD.

       6990-MAIN-X.
           EXIT.

       7000-WRITE-999-RECORDS.
           ACCEPT TIME-WORK FROM TIME.
           DISPLAY "* BEGIN WRITING TC-999 RECORDS AT ",
             TIME-WORK, " *".
           CLOSE TC-999-IN-FILE.
           SORT SORT-FILE ON ASCENDING KEY  SORT-CODE
                                            SORT-DATE
                                            SORT-TIME
               USING TC-999-IN-FILE
               GIVING TC-999-OUT-FILE.

           OPEN INPUT TC-999-OUT-FILE.
           READ TC-999-OUT-FILE AT END
               DISPLAY "***** NO RECORDS IN TC-999-OUT-FILE *****"
               GO TO 7800-CLOSE-999-FILE.
           ADD 1                         TO  TC-999-TOTAL-CNTR.
           MOVE TC-999-OUT-REC           TO  SAVE-TC-999-REC.

       7100-READ-999-FILE-LOOP.
           READ TC-999-OUT-FILE AT END
               WRITE ABST-RCD FROM SAVE-TC-999-REC
               ADD 1                     TO  TC-999-UNIQUE-CNTR
               GO TO 7800-CLOSE-999-FILE.

           ADD 1                         TO  TC-999-TOTAL-CNTR.
           IF TC-999-OUT-CODE = SAVE-TC-999-CODE
               MOVE TC-999-OUT-REC       TO  SAVE-TC-999-REC
               GO TO 7100-READ-999-FILE-LOOP
           ELSE
               WRITE ABST-RCD FROM SAVE-TC-999-REC
               MOVE TC-999-OUT-REC       TO  SAVE-TC-999-REC
               ADD 1                     TO  TC-999-UNIQUE-CNTR
               GO TO 7100-READ-999-FILE-LOOP.

       7800-CLOSE-999-FILE.
           CLOSE TC-999-OUT-FILE.
           ACCEPT TIME-WORK FROM TIME.
           DISPLAY "* TC-999-FILE CLOSED AT ", TIME-WORK, " *".
           DISPLAY "* THERE WERE ", TC-999-TOTAL-CNTR,
             " RECORDS READ (TRANSACTIONS WITH CODE), AND ",
             TC-999-UNIQUE-CNTR,
             " TC-999 RECORDS WRITTEN TO ABSTFILE *".

       7990-W9R-X.
           EXIT.

       9000-DETERMINE-TRANS-DATE.
      *------- THIS IS PERFORMED FROM 4 PLACES:
      *-------   WHEN READING DDAILYTC,
      *-------   WHEN UPDATING USAGE FILE "USYESFIL",
      *-------   WHEN UPDATING RECEIPTS FILE "RECDYSFIL",
      *-------   AND WHEN DELETING DDAILYTC.

           IF DDAILYTC-TC = "333"
               MOVE TC333-WO             TO   WO-WORK
               PERFORM 9100-CHECK-PROD-DATE
               IF PROD-DATE-FLAG = "Y"
                   NEXT SENTENCE
               ELSE
                   MOVE DDAILYTC-DATE    TO   YMD-BUILD
                   IF YY-BUILD > "70"
                       MOVE "19" TO CC-BUILD
                   ELSE
                       MOVE "20" TO CC-BUILD
                   END-IF
           ELSE
           IF DDAILYTC-TC = "433"
               MOVE TC433-WO             TO   WO-WORK
               PERFORM 9100-CHECK-PROD-DATE
               IF PROD-DATE-FLAG = "Y"
                   NEXT SENTENCE
               ELSE
                   MOVE DDAILYTC-DATE    TO   YMD-BUILD
                   IF YY-BUILD > "70"
                       MOVE "19" TO CC-BUILD
                   ELSE
                       MOVE "20" TO CC-BUILD
                   END-IF
           ELSE
           IF DDAILYTC-TC = "330"
               MOVE TC330-WO             TO   WO-WORK
               PERFORM 9100-CHECK-PROD-DATE
               IF PROD-DATE-FLAG = "Y"
                   NEXT SENTENCE
               ELSE
                   MOVE DDAILYTC-DATE    TO   YMD-BUILD
                   IF YY-BUILD > "70"
                       MOVE "19" TO CC-BUILD
                   ELSE
                       MOVE "20" TO CC-BUILD
                   END-IF
           ELSE
           IF DDAILYTC-TC = "430"
               MOVE TC430-WO             TO   WO-WORK
               PERFORM 9100-CHECK-PROD-DATE
               IF PROD-DATE-FLAG = "Y"
                   NEXT SENTENCE
               ELSE
                   MOVE DDAILYTC-DATE    TO   YMD-BUILD
                   IF YY-BUILD > "70"
                       MOVE "19" TO CC-BUILD
                   ELSE
                       MOVE "20" TO CC-BUILD
                   END-IF
           ELSE
               MOVE DDAILYTC-DATE        TO   YMD-BUILD
               IF YY-BUILD > "70"
                   MOVE "19" TO CC-BUILD
               ELSE
                   MOVE "20" TO CC-BUILD
               END-IF.

       9100-CHECK-PROD-DATE.
           MOVE "N"                      TO   PROD-DATE-FLAG.
           IF PROD-DASH-1 = "-" AND PROD-DASH-2 = "-"
           AND PROD-MM NUMERIC AND PROD-DD NUMERIC
           AND PROD-YY NUMERIC
               MOVE "Y"                  TO   PROD-DATE-FLAG
               MOVE PROD-YY              TO   YY-BUILD
               MOVE PROD-MM              TO   MM-BUILD
               MOVE PROD-DD              TO   DD-BUILD.

       9110-CALL-SCURCONV.
           CALL "SCURCONV" USING         BASE,
                                         SCURCONV-PARMS,
                                         STATUS-AREA,
                                         BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
                                         BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.

       9120-FIX-325.
      *------ WHEN WE CONVERT THE PRICE TO HOME CURRENCY, IT IS
      *------ POSSIBLE THAT IT MIGHT OVERFLOW THE 325 TRANSACTION'S
      *------ SPACE FOR PRICE AND CHANGE IT TO A 425.

           IF SCURCONV-PRICE-DEC > 9999999.99
               MOVE TC325-CORRECTION-FLAG     TO   TC425-CORRECTION-FLAG
               MOVE TC325-RS                  TO   WS-ACCUMULATOR
               MOVE WS-ACCUMULATOR-2-14       TO   TC425-RS
               MOVE TC325-ITEM                TO   TC425-ITEM
               MOVE TC325-STORED-QTY          TO   TC425-STORED-QTY
               MOVE TC325-UM                  TO   TC425-UM
               MOVE SCURCONV-PRICE-DEC        TO   TC425-PO-UNIT-PRICE
               MOVE SCURCONV-HOME-CURRENCY    TO   TC425-CURRENCY-CODE
               MOVE "425"                     TO   DDAILYTC-TC
           ELSE
               MOVE SCURCONV-PRICE-DEC        TO   TC325-PO-UNIT-PRICE
               MOVE SCURCONV-HOME-CURRENCY    TO   TC325-CURRENCY-CODE.

       9130-FIX-323.
           IF SCURCONV-PRICE-DEC > 9999999.99
               MOVE TC323-RS                  TO   WS-ACCUMULATOR
               MOVE WS-ACCUMULATOR-2-14       TO   TC423-RS
               MOVE TC323-ITEM                TO   TC423-ITEM
               MOVE TC323-CODED-RCV-QTY       TO   TC423-CODED-RCV-QTY
               MOVE TC323-UM                  TO   TC423-UM
               MOVE SCURCONV-PRICE-DEC        TO   TC423-UNIT-PRICE
               MOVE SCURCONV-HOME-CURRENCY    TO   TC423-CURRENCY-CODE
               IF DDAILYTC-TC = "323"
                   MOVE "423"                 TO   DDAILYTC-TC
               ELSE
                   MOVE "424"                 TO   DDAILYTC-TC
           ELSE
               MOVE SCURCONV-PRICE-DEC        TO   TC323-UNIT-PRICE
               MOVE SCURCONV-HOME-CURRENCY    TO   TC323-CURRENCY-CODE.

